### Pruebas manuales — Android Studio / IntelliJ (HTTP Client) o VS Code (REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = sge-dev-key

### Estado del servicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Registrar un collar
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "SGE-0001",
  "farmId": "finca-1",
  "animalId": "animal-1",
  "animalName": "Lola",
  "anchor": { "lat": 4.628, "lng": -74.065 },
  "radiusMeters": 40
}

### Listar los collares de la finca
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars?farmId=finca-1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Detalle (reemplaza el id por el que devolvió el POST)
@collarId = pega-aqui-el-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars/{{collarId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Mover el potrero y ampliar el radio
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars/{{collarId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anchor": { "lat": 4.6285, "lng": -74.0645 },
  "radiusMeters": 80
}

### Desactivar el collar (deja de reportar posición)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars/{{collarId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "INACTIVE" }

### Posición actual de un collar
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars/{{collarId}}/position
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Posiciones de todas las vacas activas de la finca (lo que consulta la app)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/positions?farmId=finca-1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Eliminar el collar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/collars/{{collarId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
